   Venverloo, Titus; Duarte, Fabio; Benson, Tom; Bitran, Quentin; Alvarez, Ricardo; Ratti, Carlo, MIT, Senseable City Lab, 77 Massachusetts Ave, Cambridge, MA 02139 USA.
   Venverloo, Titus; Beldad, Ardion D., Univ Twente, Technol Liberal Arts \& Sci, Enschede, Netherlands.
